<section class="section" aria-labelledby="options-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="options">
      <article class="option">
        <h2 id="options-heading">SEO control for AI-built websites</h2>
        <p class="option-subtitle">Your AI builds the site. You control its SEO.</p>
        <p>Turn your coding agent into a conversational SEO dashboard. Ask what your site publishes, change settings, preserve decisions, and verify the actual output—not just configuration files.</p>
        <p class="option-note">Free and open source. One setup prompt, with no required plugin or extra platform.</p>
        <a class="primary-link" href="/ai-sites/">Explore SEO for AI-built sites <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="option">
        <h2>Lightweight WordPress SEO plugin</h2>
        <p class="option-subtitle">Essential controls. Virtually no extra weight.</p>
        <p>Edit metadata in bulk, manage indexation centrally, and handle redirects and 404s. No injected front-end JavaScript or CSS, and no subscriptions or upsells.</p>
        <p class="option-note">Free and open source. Just 122 KB installed in version 1.0.0.</p>
        <a class="primary-link" href="/wordpress/">Explore the WordPress plugin <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .option { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface); padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; gap: 1rem; }
  .option h2 { font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 2.65vw, 2.1rem); }
  .option p { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .option .option-subtitle { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; margin-top: -.4rem; }
  .option .option-note { font-size: .94rem; }
  .primary-link { margin-top: auto; padding-top: .8rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; color: var(--plate); font-size: .95rem; }
  .primary-link:hover { color:#ffe29b; text-decoration: underline; }
  @media(max-width: 44rem) { .options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
